bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849290/extras/84e5bcdabe7406bd486a7af4d9c84b90.poster.avif?t=1745565693\" width=800 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849290/extras/84e5bcdabe7406bd486a7af4d9c84b90.webm?t=1745565693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849290/extras/84e5bcdabe7406bd486a7af4d9c84b90.mp4?t=1745565693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849290/extras/b357dab17a87e470dbae2a3097b026e2.poster.avif?t=1745565693\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849290/extras/b357dab17a87e470dbae2a3097b026e2.webm?t=1745565693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849290/extras/b357dab17a87e470dbae2a3097b026e2.mp4?t=1745565693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With cool display cases, nice counters, and useful storage, you can make your shop look better. You can place the furniture how you like and store more items to sell at the same time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849290/extras/7ad85e2855981c07a5052510a39ed7fc.webp?t=1745565693\" width=598 height=3 /></span></p>",
